    {
      "id": 2,
      "claim": "The Sample Regression Function (SRF) is the estimated relationship derived from a specific finite sample of data.",
      "evidence": "Standard econometric definition: SRF = Ŷ = b₀ + b₁X. It is a statistical estimate of the PRF based on observed data.",
      "weight": 0.3
